---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';
import { PUBLIC_HOSPITALS } from '@lib/constants';

const FIGURES = [
    { label: '每年每人平均就诊次数', value: '6次' },
    { label: '居民年住院率', value: '17.5%' },
    { label: '二级及以上公立医院', value: `${PUBLIC_HOSPITALS}家` },
    { label: '服务覆盖城市', value: '500个' },
];
---

<section
    class="services-health-intro section"
    aria-labelledby="services-health-intro-title"
>
    <div class="shell services-health-intro__grid">
        <div data-scroll="left">
            <SectionHead
                eyebrow="Health Management"
                headingId="services-health-intro-title"
            >
                一站式健康管理服务
                <Fragment slot="text">
                    <p>生病是人生旅途的一部分，惠泽让优质医疗资源在需要的时候真正可及。</p>
                </Fragment>
            </SectionHead>
            <div class="prose">
                <p>我国每年每人平均6次就诊，居民年住院率为17.5%。惠泽的健康管理服务围绕人民就医就诊的痛点，提供就医绿通、院内护理、术后康复、居家护理和折扣购药服务。</p>
                <p>服务覆盖全国500个城市、11000家二级及以上公立医院，聚焦脑卒中、骨科等刚需领域，为家庭提供住院&mdash;社区&mdash;居家的三级康复与照护服务。</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul
            class="services-health-intro__figures"
            data-scroll="right"
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            {FIGURES.map(figure => (
                <li class="card services-health-intro__figure">
                    <p class="services-health-intro__value">{figure.value}</p>
                    <p class="services-health-intro__label">{figure.label}</p>
                </li>
            ))}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-health-intro__figure {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .services-health-intro__figures {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.125rem;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .services-health-intro__grid {
        align-items: center;
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(2.5rem, calc(1.83rem + 3.33vw), 4.5rem);
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .services-health-intro__label {
        color: var(--color-sage);
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .services-health-intro__value {
        color: var(--color-jade);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, calc(1.5rem + 1.25vw), 2.5rem);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {

        .services-health-intro__grid {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }
    }

</style>
